<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Flink - Tag - Gengar's Pokeball</title><link>https://blog.2nfree.com/en/tags/flink/</link><description>Cloud Native, Kubernetes, DevOps and Golang notes.</description><generator>Hugo 0.167.0 &amp; FixIt v1.0.0-alpha.3</generator><language>en-US</language><managingEditor>komorebi2333@gmail.com (komorebi)</managingEditor><webMaster>komorebi2333@gmail.com (komorebi)</webMaster><lastBuildDate>Tue, 29 Sep 2026 08:32:15 +0000</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://blog.2nfree.com/en/tags/flink/atom.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Apache Flink Kubernetes Operator</title><link>https://blog.2nfree.com/en/posts/flink-operator/</link><pubDate>Wed, 05 Apr 2023 12:08:57 +0000</pubDate><author>komorebi2333@gmail.com (komorebi)</author><guid>https://blog.2nfree.com/en/posts/flink-operator/</guid><category domain="https://blog.2nfree.com/en/categories/bigdata/">BigData</category><description>&lt;h1 class="heading-element" id="前言"&gt;&lt;span&gt;前言&lt;/span&gt;&#10; &lt;a href="#%e5%89%8d%e8%a8%80" class="heading-mark"&gt;&lt;svg class="octicon octicon-link" viewBox="0 0 16 16" version="1.1" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;path d="m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z"&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;Flink Kubernetes Operator 扩展了 Kubernetes API，能够管理和操作 Flink 部署，该 Operator 具有以下特点：&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;ul&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;部署和监控 Flink Application 和 Session 的 Kubernetes Deployment&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;升级、暂停和删除 Kubernetes Deployment&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;完整的日志记录和指标集成&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;灵活的部署以及与 Kubernetes 工具的本机集成&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;/ul&gt;&#10;&lt;a class="lightgallery" target="_blank" href="https://blog.2nfree.com/en/posts/flink-operator/overview.webp" title="/en/posts/flink-operator/overview.webp" data-thumbnail="/en/posts/flink-operator/overview.webp" data-sub-html="&lt;h2&gt;/en/posts/flink-operator/overview.webp&lt;/h2&gt;"&gt;&lt;img loading="lazy" src='https://blog.2nfree.com/en/posts/flink-operator/overview.webp' alt="/en/posts/flink-operator/overview.webp" height="403" width="842"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;h1 class="heading-element" id="部署-flink-operator"&gt;&lt;span&gt;部署 flink operator&lt;/span&gt;&#10; &lt;a href="#%e9%83%a8%e7%bd%b2-flink-operator" class="heading-mark"&gt;&lt;svg class="octicon octicon-link" viewBox="0 0 16 16" version="1.1" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;path d="m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z"&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;h2 class="heading-element" id="安装-cert-manager"&gt;&lt;span&gt;安装 cert-manager&lt;/span&gt;&#10; &lt;a href="#%e5%ae%89%e8%a3%85-cert-manager" class="heading-mark"&gt;&lt;svg class="octicon octicon-link" viewBox="0 0 16 16" version="1.1" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;path d="m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z"&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;在安装 flink operator 之前，需要在 Kubernetes 集群中安装 cert-manager，如果集群之前已经安装过 cert-manager，则无需安装&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>